!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = Cells were maintained in DMEM supplemented with 5%FBS and 1% Non-essential amino acids, under 5% Co@ at 37C.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = UV crosslinked cells were lysed in 1x PXL buffer, lystates were Dnase treated, partially RnaseA digested, clarified by centrifugation, and Argonaute-mRNA complexes isolated with pan-Ago 2A8 antibody.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Libraries were prepared as in Moore M et al. 2014 but with the following modifications. The 2nd PCR step was used to introduce library specific indices that were additionally compatible with MiSeq sequencers using version2 chemistry.
!Sample_description = CLIP-seq
!Sample_data_processing = Sequenced reads were trimmed for adaptor sequence, if any, and then mapped to hg18 whole genome using novoalign. Mapped reads were collapsed on the basis of the 5'prime degenerate linker, as in Moore et al., Nature Protocols, 2014.
!Sample_data_processing = Collapsed mapped reads were clustered, where the peak cluster coordinate +/- 32 nt was searched for the presence of miRNA 6-8mers, for those miRNAs with CLIP evidence.
!Sample_data_processing = Fold changes were calculated by adding a psuedocount of 1 to every cluster, normalizing each cluster for read depth (reads per million mapped), and dividing by condition.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: hg18
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: tab-delimited text file includes HiTS-CLIP cluster definition and locations, miRNA seed search results, and genomic annotations.
!Sample_platform_id = GPL11154
